From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: nowon <nowon@noreply.pepecoin.surf>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 20:47:02 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 143/144] GreatDANE: retarget product URLs and the default
 top-site tiles to dane.surf (round 5a)

Repoint the manual download, details/releases, AUS pref, compiled-in
MOZ_APPUPDATE_HOST, README reinstall link, and privacy-manifest text
from pepecoin.surf / dogecoin.surf to dane.surf.

Default top sites: replace the pepecoin.surf and dogecoin.surf tiles
with one https://dane.surf/ tile; keep https://greatdane.doge/. The
dane.surf tippytop image and favicon are byte copies of the site icons
(img/icon-192.png and img/favicon-32.png).

The AUS URL is https://dane.surf/update/3/%PRODUCT%/.../update.xml
(no /dane/ prefix). https://dane.surf/releases/ and
https://dane.surf/update/ are not on the site yet (404 as of
2026-11-10). This change only retargets the URLs; nothing is published
to AUS, and no update.xml or releases page is added.

Not changed: node seeds, .doge/.pepe names, the greatdane.doge tile,
the PepeNet desktop releases URL, publisher-check fixtures, patch
author emails, or historical evidence/.
